  "prefLabel": "Ve-H 212.03 Role of the Staff of the Home",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ve-H 212.03 Role of the Staff of the Home. The members of the staff of the home shall have no role in any hearing other than that of witnesses unless they petition for, and are granted, the right to intervene.\n\nSource. #8951, eff 7-21-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ve-h100-400.html"
